<Layout
  title="About usignpdf - Our Story"
  seo={{
    page_description: "Meet the team behind usignpdf, the frictionless e-signature tool for small businesses.",
    canonical_url: "https://usignpdf.com/about/"
  }}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 md:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">About usignpdf</h1>
    <div class="prose max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg">We built usignpdf because we were tired of paying enterprise prices just to get a handful of documents signed each month.</p>
      <p>As freelancers and small agency owners, every time we sent a contract, we felt a twinge of guilt making our clients create yet another account, remember another password, and navigate a complex enterprise tool just to type their name.</p>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>To provide a <a href="/legality">legally binding</a>, frictionless e-signature experience that respects both the sender's budget and the signer's time. Check out our <a href="/pricing">transparent pricing</a> or read our <a href="/faq">FAQ</a> for more details.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
